  "historyNote": "#6983-B, eff 4-23-99 (formerly Env-A 901.06); amd by #7973, eff 10-21-03); ss by #8872, eff 4-21-07; ss by #10892, eff 7-18-15; ss by #14374, eff 9-20-25, EXPIRES: 9-20-35",
